        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dick Purcell, Lorna Gray, Lionel Atwill\n- Works: Captain America (1943 film serial)\n- Companies: Republic Pictures\n- Topics: superhero film serials\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Gerald \"Dick\" Purcell Jr. was an American actor who lived from August 6, 1908 to April 10, 1944.\n- Dick Purcell was best known for playing Marvel Comics' Captain America in the 1943 film serial Captain America.\n- Lorna Gray and Lionel Atwill co-starred with Dick Purcell in the 1943 film serial Captain America.\n- Captain America was the last Republic serial made about a superhero.",
